s": [{"type": "text", "content": " Let's rebrand a company. "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Instructions:</span> Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le14ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn8le14ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "20", "text": "Hello everyone and thank you for coming. We have all been under a lot of pressure lately. A crisis is, indeed, a stressful situation. However, if everyone maintains the same goals, a crisis can certainly be overcome. When it comes to overcoming one, it is important to discuss how to move forward.\n</br>\nA great job was done handling the early stages of the crisis. From a brand perspective, however, we're still not out of the woods yet. I feel it's a bit too soon to be patting ourselves on the back. Farmani and his company were hit hard and, as a result, the company's profitability was affected. A negative association was made so my plan is to rebrand the company.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn8le14ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "43000", "text": "Rebranding Holly's means developing a new, differentiated identity that will distance itself from negative connotations of the previous branding. In order for that to happen, the client needs to be taken through the process with great sensitivity and care.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn8le14ob04re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "59000", "text": "How the process is carried out: First, the reason why the company needs to be rebranded is to be determined. In this case, it's a corrective step due to a scandal.\nSecond, research is conducted so as to identify changes the company needs to make.\nThird, a decision is made on how much of the company our client wants to rebrand.\nFinally, the costs of rebranding are estimated and a rebranding team is created.\n</br>\nShall we take a break? I was informed some food and drinks are awaiting for us at the cafeteria.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn8le14ob04re2img07.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn8le14ob04re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "26000", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What are the steps to follow when giving an unstructured presentation?</span>", "id": 0, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn8le14ob04re4vid01"}}], "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}